{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-liv-maritime","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"liv-maritime-liv-developers-maritime-city","about":"Welcome to LIV Maritime, a 47-story boutique tower redefining luxury waterfront living in Dubai Maritime City. Choose from 1, 2, and 3 bedroom apartments, as well as exclusive duplexes and townhouses, all thoughtfully designed with state-of-the-art smart home technology, premium European kitchens, and bespoke interiors.LIV Maritime by LIV Real Estate Development sets a new benchmark for refined living, tailored to discerning buyers seeking exclusivity and comfort. With its striking glass architecture and prime location, this iconic residence offers breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea, Jumeirah Coastline, Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina, and the Downtown Dubai skyline.Residents enjoy over 29,000 sq. ft. of premium amenities, including an oversized pool, a zen garden, a dedicated spa, and much more. Perfectly positioned for effortless access to Dubai's key landmarks, LIV Maritime is just minutes away from world-class destinations such as the Bulgari Resort and La Mer. Blending tranquility and urban connectivity, LIV Maritime truly represents the ultimate waterfront address.","price":1500000,"title":"LIV Maritime","bitrix":{"id":1055,"pf_id":"are.2.14835","source":null,"project_id":"LIV Maritime","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"LIV Maritime","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"LIV Developers","project_location":"Maritime City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feat_c87483e63b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/feat_c87483e63b.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2706482,"lng":55.2688468},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/1_253817e483.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/1_253817e